Confirming the endpoint conventions, these are final and override the draft PDF where they differ.
All of them live under the versioned base path `/item/v1/item`.

- **Create** → `PUT /item/v1/item`
  Note: we create with **PUT**, like our other backends — **not POST**. The draft said POST, ignore
  that, it was wrong.
- **Update** → `POST /item/v1/item/{guid}`
- **Delete** → `DELETE /item/v1/item/{guid}`
- **Search** → `POST /item/v1/item/search` (filters go in the request body: the search string,
  the offset, the page size and the sort order)
- **Detail** → `GET /item/v1/item/{guid}`

Remember: every one of these still answers **HTTP 200**, with the real code in the status object.

Marco
